1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,770
Speaking, task three. Story number 19: A police check. What happened to Mr Novák yesterday evening? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:15,008
What happened to Mr Novák yesterday evening?

3
00:00:35,667 --> 00:00:38,433
Yesterday evening Mr Novák was driving home from work.

4
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:42,233
He was tired and in a hurry because he wanted to watch football.

5
00:00:42,433 --> 00:00:44,967
On the road outside town the police stopped him.

6
00:00:45,167 --> 00:00:50,433
The police officer said good evening and wanted to see his driving licence, vehicle registration and insurance.

7
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:52,667
Mr Novák showed him everything.

8
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:57,467
Then the officer told him he had been driving too fast — seventy instead of fifty.

9
00:00:57,667 --> 00:01:00,400
Mr Novák had to pay a fine of a thousand crowns.

10
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,600
He drove home slowly and only saw the football on TV.

11
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:13,463
Tell story 19 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
